WEBVTT

02:23.588 --> 02:25.882
[Episode 5: I'm Overheated]

02:45.286 --> 02:47.618
Ma'am?

02:48.679 --> 02:51.792
I'm a little overheated.

02:51.792 --> 02:53.599
I'll pay.

02:54.666 --> 02:56.149
Ma'am,

02:56.149 --> 02:58.723
if you drink all this, you could die.

02:58.723 --> 03:00.087
That's the plan.

03:00.087 --> 03:03.576
Did something happen?

03:09.136 --> 03:11.659
I don't even know.

03:11.659 --> 03:14.065
What this even is.

03:22.579 --> 03:24.882
Hey, you okay?

03:24.882 --> 03:26.792
You alive in there?

03:26.792 --> 03:29.573
Why are you taking so long?

03:51.341 --> 03:54.229
You'll pass out at this rate.

03:57.899 --> 04:00.136
Grab me a beer too.

04:07.012 --> 04:09.688
Why is your face so red?

04:09.688 --> 04:11.585
Are you sick?

04:11.585 --> 04:13.609
Do you have a fever?

04:13.609 --> 04:15.706
No fever.

04:19.234 --> 04:21.491
I just shouldn't have flirted.

04:21.491 --> 04:24.642
Would've been a problem
if you fell for me again.

04:24.642 --> 04:26.986
Can that just happen?

04:26.986 --> 04:30.510
With someone you already know?
Catching feelings out of nowhere.

04:30.510 --> 04:31.600
Like getting struck by lightning.

04:31.600 --> 04:35.308
- Wait, did you actually fall for me?
- That would take actual lightning.

04:38.174 --> 04:40.945
Of course it can happen.

04:40.945 --> 04:44.438
If something makes you see them differently.

04:44.438 --> 04:47.955
Or maybe you liked them all along.

04:47.955 --> 04:52.715
All those feelings build up
without you even realizing it,

04:52.715 --> 04:55.352
then boom, they explode.

04:55.352 --> 04:57.035
Like lava.

04:58.134 --> 04:59.824
"Like lava..."

05:01.037 --> 05:03.279
[J Care Hospital]

05:08.612 --> 05:10.717
Mom...

05:12.252 --> 05:14.729
The people here

05:14.729 --> 05:17.879
aren't trying to hurt you.

05:17.879 --> 05:20.123
They're trying to help.

05:21.019 --> 05:24.107
If you keep refusing your meds
and making a scene,

05:24.994 --> 05:27.567
you'll have to go back to the main hospital.

05:35.347 --> 05:37.560
[Father]

05:45.250 --> 05:47.735
- Yeah, Father.
- Where are you?

05:47.735 --> 05:50.168
- I'm working out.
- You don't have that kind of time.

05:50.168 --> 05:51.745
What the hell are you doing?

05:51.745 --> 05:54.299
You made a whole show of bringing that guy in.

05:54.299 --> 05:56.265
So why aren't you using him properly?

05:56.265 --> 05:58.595
How did you let it blow up like this?

05:58.595 --> 05:59.619
[Haemu Fires James Lockett]

05:59.619 --> 06:01.012
I hear Audit made the call.

06:01.012 --> 06:03.372
And you still can't get a handle
on your people?

06:03.372 --> 06:05.722
Why are you so damn soft?

06:05.722 --> 06:07.496
Don't forget your position.

06:07.496 --> 06:10.430
If you can't handle it, you collapse.
Just like your mother.

06:27.937 --> 06:31.783
Starting today, include Joo In Ah
in the executive movement reports.

06:31.783 --> 06:34.853
Executive monitoring reports
come through Audit,

06:34.853 --> 06:37.929
so the Head of Audit wouldn't normally be...

06:39.827 --> 06:41.185
Understood.

06:41.185 --> 06:44.329
We'll handle it directly
from the Secretary's Office going forward.

07:12.412 --> 07:14.562
Hello, ma'am.

07:14.562 --> 07:16.462
Oh, hello.

07:16.462 --> 07:19.889
Sorry I missed you at the Audit team dinner.

07:19.889 --> 07:21.866
Same here. Maybe next time.

07:21.866 --> 07:23.390
Or...

07:23.390 --> 07:25.680
How about a drink sometime?

07:25.680 --> 07:27.850
Just the two of us.

07:30.398 --> 07:33.043
You really think that'd be any fun?

07:33.043 --> 07:34.283
We don't exactly have much in common.

07:34.283 --> 07:36.463
Why not? We might.

07:36.463 --> 07:40.678
I have a feeling there's something
we have in common.

08:13.438 --> 08:15.404
Good morning.

08:16.379 --> 08:17.956
You're in.

08:17.956 --> 08:19.696
Let's grab a coffee.

08:19.696 --> 08:21.676
We should talk.

08:22.512 --> 08:24.199
Skip the coffee.

08:24.199 --> 08:26.824
We'll talk in the interview room.

09:09.176 --> 09:12.540
- About yesterday...
- About yesterday, I'm sorry.

09:12.540 --> 09:15.678
As your superior, I shouldn't have done that.

09:15.678 --> 09:18.068
If you want to file a formal complaint,

09:18.068 --> 09:19.529
go ahead.

09:19.529 --> 09:22.276
I'll take full responsibility.

09:23.683 --> 09:27.100
I think you've got this completely wrong.

09:27.100 --> 09:29.409
I'm the one who kissed you.

09:30.184 --> 09:32.502
What are you talking about? I kissed you.

09:32.502 --> 09:35.229
No, I did. I kissed you.

09:35.229 --> 09:37.649
- I started it. Don't push it.
- "Push it?"

09:37.649 --> 09:41.952
Is this something you can just override
with your title?

09:41.952 --> 09:44.515
Why are you so set on winning this?

09:44.515 --> 09:46.469
- If I say I did it, I did it.
- I did.

09:46.469 --> 09:50.155
- I did!
- Why did you do it, then?

09:52.348 --> 09:54.932
Why did you kiss me?

09:54.932 --> 09:57.001
If it was you?

09:59.382 --> 10:01.254
I was drunk

10:01.254 --> 10:02.880
on art.

10:02.880 --> 10:05.597
You're really good at drawing.
It was beautiful.

10:05.597 --> 10:08.834
And the music in the background,
soft and mellow...

10:08.834 --> 10:11.798
The whole moment, the aesthetic of it...

10:11.798 --> 10:13.271
it was intoxicating.

10:13.271 --> 10:14.721
There's science behind it too.

10:14.721 --> 10:17.358
Great art boosts dopamine,

10:17.358 --> 10:21.085
puts your body on edge,
speeds up your breathing and heart rate.

10:22.414 --> 10:24.671
Like you're under a spell.

10:32.922 --> 10:35.338
My drawing does all that?

10:35.338 --> 10:38.059
What am I, Michelangelo?

10:38.059 --> 10:40.854
Maybe I'll start calling you Noh-chelangelo.

10:43.338 --> 10:47.588
So you got drunk on art,
and that's your excuse?

10:48.369 --> 10:50.095
Then why did you do it?

10:50.095 --> 10:53.008
If you kissed me first.

10:57.385 --> 10:59.563
Because you looked beautiful.

11:00.591 --> 11:03.575
I wasn't drunk. I was perfectly sober.

11:03.575 --> 11:06.063
You looked so beautiful.

11:07.923 --> 11:10.266
That's why I kissed you.

11:19.416 --> 11:21.328
Yeah, I'm beautiful.

11:22.085 --> 11:23.127
Anyone can see that.

11:23.127 --> 11:25.552
My features are sharp,
everything's well balanced.

11:25.552 --> 11:27.141
Objectively, I'm attractive.

11:27.141 --> 11:28.698
I know.

11:28.698 --> 11:31.912
That doesn't mean everyone gets to kiss me.

11:37.072 --> 11:38.969
No matter who started it,

11:38.969 --> 11:42.422
what happened between us yesterday
was inappropriate.

11:42.422 --> 11:44.106
We need to make sure it doesn't happen again.

11:44.106 --> 11:46.986
Let's keep some distance, just to be safe.

11:46.986 --> 11:50.142
Strict line between work and personal.
That's it.

11:57.885 --> 11:59.442
By the way...

11:59.442 --> 12:02.102
That really pisses me off.

12:02.102 --> 12:04.228
Kissing me, then apologizing for it.

12:10.690 --> 12:14.588
Year of the Dragon, '88.
Today's fortune says...

12:14.588 --> 12:16.341
[Year of the Dragon, '88]
[Get your space in order]

12:16.341 --> 12:18.365
"Get your space in order."

12:18.365 --> 12:22.819
And Hae Young, Year of the Snake, '89...

12:24.564 --> 12:26.455
"A benefactor is coming from the west."

12:26.455 --> 12:28.248
- The west?
- Hey.

12:28.248 --> 12:30.545
I live in Bucheon. That's west.

12:30.545 --> 12:32.758
Your lucky guy right here.

12:32.758 --> 12:36.658
And Team Leader, Year of the Sheep.

12:36.658 --> 12:39.622
"Stay off your superiors' radar."

12:39.622 --> 12:41.771
- Superiors?
- Yeah, superiors.

12:43.400 --> 12:44.951
Which superiors, though?

12:45.734 --> 12:47.141
What's with him?

12:49.005 --> 12:50.895
Man, seriously...

12:50.895 --> 12:53.362
Things have really changed.

12:53.362 --> 12:55.347
This world, I swear.

12:56.292 --> 12:58.706
What's up with those two this morning?

12:58.706 --> 13:01.064
Mr. Noh's been on her bad side.

13:01.064 --> 13:04.069
I thought things got better
after the James case.

13:04.069 --> 13:07.606
At this rate, what if he really gets MJYS?

13:07.606 --> 13:11.544
We should step in and help Ki Jun.

13:11.544 --> 13:13.990
Get him back in her good graces.

13:13.990 --> 13:15.462
Oh right.

13:15.462 --> 13:17.999
Yeah, AI's big these days.

13:17.999 --> 13:19.483
AI.

13:26.589 --> 13:28.544
Lucky him, Manager Do.

13:28.544 --> 13:31.332
Looks like this is his year.
Getting married and all.

13:31.332 --> 13:34.082
And top sales at Haemu Cosmetics. Best ever.

13:34.082 --> 13:36.856
Come on, it's not his first time.

13:36.856 --> 13:41.729
Man... I've asked for his secret,
but he never gives it up.

13:42.443 --> 13:44.481
- Let's grab a smoke.
- Yeah, let's go.

14:07.493 --> 14:08.950
All right, here we go.

14:08.950 --> 14:11.997
One, two, three.

14:29.366 --> 14:31.057
Let go!

14:36.743 --> 14:40.778
I'm not involved with her.

14:40.778 --> 14:43.559
She's a purchasing team leader
for a Haemu Cosmetics client.

14:43.559 --> 14:47.912
I'm just the lowly sales guy.
She's the buyer, top of the chain.

14:47.912 --> 14:49.064
That's all it is.

14:49.064 --> 14:52.456
Then why'd she pull that stunt at your wedding?

14:52.456 --> 14:53.560
Exactly.

14:53.560 --> 14:56.313
You think I wasn't shocked?

14:56.313 --> 14:59.277
If there'd been anything going on,
I wouldn't have invited her.

14:59.277 --> 15:01.377
I'm not an idiot.

15:02.388 --> 15:04.138
I'm seriously the victim here, guys.

15:04.138 --> 15:06.671
We're not your "guys."

15:06.671 --> 15:09.575
Sit up straight. You're not here to hang out.

15:09.575 --> 15:11.288
Sorry.

15:11.288 --> 15:14.137
If it were a big deal,

15:14.137 --> 15:18.263
would I still be happily married?

15:18.263 --> 15:21.730
Still, there's got to be a reason
she went that far.

15:21.730 --> 15:24.997
Didn't you give her the wrong idea?

15:28.226 --> 15:30.070
Actually,

15:30.070 --> 15:33.099
I do have a bit of a sales trick.

15:33.736 --> 15:37.093
I sell lipstick, right?

15:37.093 --> 15:39.473
Most buyers are women.

15:39.473 --> 15:41.450
And between men and women,
there's always a bit of...

15:41.450 --> 15:43.910
you know, sexual chemistry.

15:43.910 --> 15:46.914
I just make the most of that.

15:46.914 --> 15:48.340
So what,

15:48.340 --> 15:50.170
you slept your way to those deals?

15:50.170 --> 15:52.204
Hey... no.

15:52.204 --> 15:54.413
Nothing like that.

15:56.192 --> 15:57.235
It's flirting.

15:57.235 --> 15:58.387
That's it.

15:58.387 --> 16:01.374
First, keep it subtle. Second, keep it classy.

16:01.374 --> 16:04.871
How? Make her feel good,

16:04.871 --> 16:07.124
while keeping things just on edge.

16:07.124 --> 16:09.214
You don't cross the line,

16:09.214 --> 16:11.304
you just create the vibe.

16:11.304 --> 16:14.951
Most people know exactly what it is
and enjoy it.

16:14.951 --> 16:18.681
Maybe Team Leader So just got the wrong idea.

16:20.802 --> 16:23.795
We were definitely seeing each other.

16:25.989 --> 16:29.365
We didn't need some "official start date."

16:29.365 --> 16:31.979
At some point, you just know...

16:31.979 --> 16:34.003
this is something real.

16:34.003 --> 16:35.570
I was confused at first.

16:35.570 --> 16:39.630
I thought maybe it was just a sales tactic...

16:46.545 --> 16:48.396
Is it that bad?

16:48.396 --> 16:49.872
When I said I was sick,

16:49.872 --> 16:53.499
he showed up in the middle of the night
with porridge and medicine.

16:53.499 --> 16:56.999
You don't do that unless you actually care.

16:56.999 --> 16:58.421
Dress warm.

16:58.421 --> 17:00.279
Normally, sure.

17:00.279 --> 17:01.869
But in this case,

17:01.869 --> 17:05.436
I needed that payment ASAP,
and she said she was too sick to send it.

17:05.436 --> 17:08.522
So what do I do? I had to get her better, fast.

17:08.522 --> 17:10.773
I hit a nearby pharmacy,
bought the strongest stuff they had,

17:10.773 --> 17:11.807
brought it over.

17:11.807 --> 17:13.909
Make sure you heat this up.

17:13.909 --> 17:16.819
She loved it.
Payment came through the next day.

17:16.819 --> 17:18.115
Hang in there!

17:19.219 --> 17:23.192
So I said yes when he asked me out.

17:23.192 --> 17:26.183
We went to a movie, had dinner...

17:26.183 --> 17:28.614
like a normal date.

17:28.614 --> 17:32.069
She thought that was a date?

17:32.876 --> 17:34.420
She kept saying

17:34.420 --> 17:37.300
she was bored just lying around at home,

17:37.300 --> 17:41.353
so I sent her some company movie tickets.

17:41.353 --> 17:43.107
Then she said Saturday worked best.

17:43.107 --> 17:47.390
To me, it felt like
going into the office on a weekend.

17:47.390 --> 17:49.438
"Going into the office?"

17:49.438 --> 17:52.777
Every time we met, he'd call me pretty, cute,

17:52.777 --> 17:54.847
wipe my lips when I got food on them...

17:54.847 --> 17:56.814
Is that

17:56.814 --> 17:58.749
part of the job?

18:00.703 --> 18:02.299
Look at this.

18:03.937 --> 18:05.617
"Good morning,"

18:05.617 --> 18:07.296
"Sweet dreams."

18:07.296 --> 18:10.172
He texted me every day.

18:10.172 --> 18:12.542
And you're saying that meant nothing?

18:12.542 --> 18:15.066
All right, let me take a look.

18:15.979 --> 18:17.800
Let's see.

18:18.965 --> 18:21.714
[Have a good one]
[Sweet dreams. See you tomorrow]

18:23.524 --> 18:25.422
Yeah, I see it.

18:26.491 --> 18:27.914
Right.

18:28.656 --> 18:30.680
We actually

18:30.680 --> 18:33.817
went through his phone,

18:33.817 --> 18:36.850
and he sent the same messages
to all his clients.

18:36.850 --> 18:39.365
Like he was running a macro.

18:40.610 --> 18:42.216
"A macro?"

18:43.416 --> 18:44.860
What a psycho.

18:44.860 --> 18:48.513
Do you have anything more concrete?

18:48.513 --> 18:52.353
Something that clearly proves
the two of you were involved?

18:54.892 --> 18:56.587
A kiss.

18:57.905 --> 19:00.908
We actually kissed.

19:00.908 --> 19:02.445
A kiss?

19:04.644 --> 19:07.992
This is driving me crazy.

19:07.992 --> 19:11.290
I keep things strictly professional.

19:11.290 --> 19:12.996
Physical contact? Never.

19:12.996 --> 19:14.780
You brought her medicine at night,

19:14.780 --> 19:16.706
went to a movie, texted her nonstop,

19:16.706 --> 19:19.016
- but no kiss?
- No.

19:19.016 --> 19:20.669
Never.

19:25.901 --> 19:28.557
Why'd you stop halfway?

19:28.557 --> 19:31.168
You brought in a client employee,
even did an interview.

19:31.168 --> 19:32.895
And you're filing this with no conclusion?

19:32.895 --> 19:35.682
This is personal. Between the two of them.

19:35.682 --> 19:37.859
They're telling different stories
about the same thing.

19:37.859 --> 19:40.174
How am I supposed to verify that objectively?

19:40.174 --> 19:41.660
You know what they say.

19:41.660 --> 19:44.564
The truth between two people
isn't with either one.

19:44.564 --> 19:46.270
It's somewhere in between.

19:46.270 --> 19:48.527
Then go find it.

19:48.527 --> 19:50.551
There's a clear contradiction.

19:50.551 --> 19:52.914
She says they kissed. He says they didn't.

19:52.914 --> 19:55.108
That's a key issue.

19:55.108 --> 19:59.091
If he did kiss her and is denying it,
that could be sexual harassment.

19:59.091 --> 20:01.308
He could also lose the client.

20:01.308 --> 20:04.063
And it's deeply disrespectful to her.

20:08.057 --> 20:11.157
So a kiss is that big a deal. Right?

20:12.064 --> 20:14.258
I thought even if you kissed someone,

20:15.041 --> 20:17.938
an apology would wrap it up.

20:22.735 --> 20:25.047
Let's stick to the case.

20:25.675 --> 20:27.672
Where did it happen?

20:32.465 --> 20:35.266
They say they kissed after drinking here.

20:38.249 --> 20:40.234
Be specific.

20:40.234 --> 20:43.172
Are you going to keep doing half-baked work?

20:54.651 --> 20:57.842
They had a few cocktails at the bar upstairs.

20:57.842 --> 21:00.786
Team Leader So can't hold her liquor,
so she got pretty drunk.

21:00.786 --> 21:02.990
She was having trouble staying on her feet.

21:02.990 --> 21:04.477
Then she said,

21:15.636 --> 21:17.883
"I feel dizzy."

21:18.626 --> 21:20.446
What?

21:21.694 --> 21:26.044
Then Manager Do stepped in to support her,

21:28.977 --> 21:31.716
and they ended up standing like this.

21:46.739 --> 21:48.843
You don't need to act it out.

21:48.843 --> 21:53.013
You just told me to be specific.
Make up your mind.

21:55.423 --> 21:56.767
There's a CCTV camera.

21:56.767 --> 21:58.108
Let's pull the footage.

21:58.108 --> 22:00.208
That looks fake.

22:03.296 --> 22:04.587
How can you tell?

22:04.587 --> 22:06.611
Look.

22:06.611 --> 22:08.968
No wiring,

22:08.968 --> 22:10.894
no power light.

22:12.042 --> 22:13.872
See? It's cold.

22:13.872 --> 22:16.100
This thing's never been on.

22:16.100 --> 22:20.277
Wow, you're pretty sharp.

22:27.195 --> 22:30.300
Still, places like this usually have something.

22:49.363 --> 22:50.524
So,

22:50.624 --> 22:53.240
did the DOJ meeting go through?

22:53.240 --> 22:55.264
I heard JB pulled some strings.

22:55.264 --> 22:57.070
Come on.

22:57.070 --> 23:00.310
You finally ask me to golf,
and this is what you bring up?

23:03.362 --> 23:04.553
Sir,

23:04.553 --> 23:06.677
MD Jeon is calling.
What would you like me to do?

23:06.677 --> 23:08.124
Tell him I'll call back.

23:08.124 --> 23:09.165
Yes, sir.

23:16.294 --> 23:18.638
She's insanely pretty.
Can you even get any work done?

23:18.638 --> 23:20.662
She's sharp. Detail-oriented.

23:20.662 --> 23:21.979
You're way too uptight.

23:21.979 --> 23:24.619
Come on, I get it.

23:24.619 --> 23:27.621
You need somewhere to let off steam.

23:28.866 --> 23:32.379
I know your marriage is business,
but your wife is...

23:33.700 --> 23:36.738
Even if my dad beat me to death,
I couldn't live with someone like that.

23:41.872 --> 23:44.162
- Hello, sir.
- Hello.

23:44.162 --> 23:46.013
That chicken looks amazing.

23:46.013 --> 23:49.835
From over there,
I thought it was a turkey. It's huge.

23:49.835 --> 23:51.472
Tastes just as good.

23:51.472 --> 23:54.252
Mr. Noh, isn't that spinning thing fun?

23:54.252 --> 23:57.705
Every time you act up,
I should tie you up and spin you like that.

23:57.705 --> 24:00.278
Oh, so that's your thing.

24:02.731 --> 24:05.975
Sir, how often are you out here?

24:05.975 --> 24:08.252
Every day except Sunday.

24:08.252 --> 24:09.699
I see.

24:09.699 --> 24:14.536
Do you always park at that exact angle?

24:15.382 --> 24:16.906
Sorry?

24:16.906 --> 24:20.825
Do you always park like this?

24:24.162 --> 24:26.677
Wow, that smells incredible.

24:26.677 --> 24:29.256
Mr. Noh, take all of this
and share it with your family.

24:29.256 --> 24:31.076
You've got a big one, right?

24:31.741 --> 24:33.358
We all live separately now.

24:33.358 --> 24:35.700
Oh, so you live alone now?

24:35.700 --> 24:36.916
Yeah.

24:44.480 --> 24:46.002
Hello?

24:50.283 --> 24:52.306
Wrong number.

24:59.246 --> 25:01.303
Who was that?

25:01.303 --> 25:03.996
Just a wrong number.

25:03.996 --> 25:05.439
Let's see.

25:06.040 --> 25:07.846
The angle looks right.

25:07.846 --> 25:09.666
Run it back.

25:09.666 --> 25:11.643
This is...

25:11.643 --> 25:14.946
between 10 and 12.

25:16.676 --> 25:18.417
There it is.

25:40.547 --> 25:43.245
Wow. They really did it.

25:54.647 --> 25:57.184
We got a call that
Director Choi's second child was hurt,

25:57.184 --> 25:58.795
so I told him to head out.

25:58.795 --> 25:59.894
Good call.

25:59.894 --> 26:01.528
Tell him to take whatever time he needs.

26:01.528 --> 26:03.152
Got it.

26:03.152 --> 26:05.603
I'll drive you today.

26:06.489 --> 26:07.859
No, it's fine.

26:07.859 --> 26:09.501
I'll drive.

26:14.226 --> 26:15.946
All right.

26:19.527 --> 26:21.126
Secretary Park.

26:24.797 --> 26:26.954
Where's your new place?

26:45.616 --> 26:48.173
You can drop me off here.

26:54.633 --> 26:56.650
Thank you.

26:57.493 --> 26:59.157
Secretary Park.

26:59.157 --> 27:01.426
From now on, routine driving

27:01.426 --> 27:03.912
will be handled by Director Choi or Do Young.

27:03.912 --> 27:06.726
I want you focused on your work.

27:11.209 --> 27:13.539
You don't have to do that.

27:13.539 --> 27:17.219
If this is because you're uncomfortable
about how I feel...

27:19.424 --> 27:21.620
I'm living

27:21.620 --> 27:23.758
with a guy.

27:24.930 --> 27:27.391
He's a really decent guy.

27:27.976 --> 27:31.383
So don't worry.

27:32.806 --> 27:35.453
I'm not going to make things messy.

27:40.761 --> 27:42.797
Speak of the devil...

27:43.648 --> 27:46.471
Then... see you tomorrow.

28:02.338 --> 28:03.971
What is it?

28:05.724 --> 28:07.508
Sorry.

28:07.508 --> 28:09.437
I used you for a second.

28:09.437 --> 28:11.461
- Is this about a guy?
- It's a secret.

28:11.461 --> 28:13.929
What do you want for dinner? My treat.

28:13.929 --> 28:15.679
Why's everyone so secretive?

28:15.679 --> 28:18.914
- Who else is keeping secrets?
- I've got one too, and I'm not telling.

28:33.443 --> 28:36.347
Doesn't this make it clear?

28:36.347 --> 28:38.577
About me and Manager Do.

28:38.577 --> 28:41.971
If you kiss, that means you're dating, right?

28:41.971 --> 28:45.174
You don't just kiss someone you're not seeing.

28:45.174 --> 28:48.525
Am I that old-fashioned?

28:48.525 --> 28:50.643
If you went as far as a kiss,

28:50.643 --> 28:52.380
shouldn't there be

28:52.380 --> 28:56.682
some sense of responsibility?

28:56.682 --> 28:58.980
Yeah, right.

28:58.980 --> 29:01.843
But according to Manager Do...

29:02.793 --> 29:04.342
Wait, did I?

29:05.325 --> 29:09.262
Now that I think about it, maybe.

29:09.262 --> 29:11.779
Was I just that drunk?

29:11.779 --> 29:15.205
If anything, it didn't mean much to me.

29:15.205 --> 29:17.149
She kept coming on to me,

29:17.149 --> 29:19.080
so I just went along with it.

29:19.080 --> 29:20.848
You know how it is, huh?

29:24.182 --> 29:25.808
You know...

29:25.808 --> 29:28.421
I'm old enough.

29:28.421 --> 29:30.299
I'm not an idiot.

29:30.299 --> 29:34.691
I know the difference
between a momentary mistake

29:34.691 --> 29:37.249
and a real emotional connection.

29:39.456 --> 29:40.843
Right!

29:41.767 --> 29:43.264
It's not the same.

29:43.264 --> 29:44.910
It's not

29:44.910 --> 29:47.337
that you're old-fashioned.

29:47.337 --> 29:50.198
If anything, you know better,
so you feel it more.

29:50.198 --> 29:52.391
Yeah, exactly.

29:52.391 --> 29:54.896
What? He called it a mistake?

29:54.896 --> 29:56.868
He doesn't even remember?

29:56.868 --> 29:58.748
- What, does he have amnesia?
- I know.

29:58.748 --> 30:01.505
You can't kiss by yourself.
Why's he acting like it was one-sided?

30:01.505 --> 30:03.582
You're still trying to make sense of this,

30:03.582 --> 30:06.185
and he's saying it was nothing
and calling it done?

30:06.185 --> 30:07.776
How is that even possible?

30:07.776 --> 30:09.119
So what?

30:09.119 --> 30:11.402
That doesn't change anything, does it?

30:11.402 --> 30:13.833
Just because we kissed once
doesn't mean we're dating.

30:13.833 --> 30:17.145
People kiss as a greeting overseas.

30:17.145 --> 30:19.574
So what,

30:19.574 --> 30:22.168
I kiss her once and now
I'm responsible for her?

30:25.301 --> 30:28.661
Of course if you kiss, you're dating.

30:28.661 --> 30:32.292
You kiss because you're together,
and if you kissed, then you're together.

30:32.292 --> 30:33.769
Back in the day, our ancestors

30:33.769 --> 30:35.926
just talked a few times
and took responsibility.

30:35.926 --> 30:37.612
They got married and all that.

30:37.612 --> 30:39.424
What era are you living in?

30:39.424 --> 30:42.886
These days it's "hook up first, date later,"
or "sleep first, then see where it goes."

30:42.886 --> 30:43.946
Hook up what?

30:43.946 --> 30:46.346
You sleep together first, then start dating.

30:46.346 --> 30:50.626
Same with the other one.
You hook up, then decide if you want more.

30:50.626 --> 30:53.323
But isn't kissing different?

30:53.323 --> 30:56.443
There's this old movie, Pretty Woman.

30:56.443 --> 31:02.506
Julia Roberts and Richard Gere
do just about everything,

31:02.506 --> 31:06.019
but she says, "No kissing."

31:06.019 --> 31:07.109
Why?

31:07.109 --> 31:11.756
Because a kiss is more emotional
than sleeping together.

31:11.756 --> 31:14.804
I'm not saying I like Manager Do,

31:14.804 --> 31:17.449
but people mess up when they drink.

31:17.449 --> 31:18.927
I mean,

31:18.927 --> 31:22.290
physical stuff and dating
don't always go together.

31:22.290 --> 31:23.474
Maybe.

31:23.474 --> 31:25.343
We'd need the full context,

31:25.343 --> 31:27.520
but the fact that he lied makes me think

31:27.520 --> 31:31.386
that kiss wasn't meaningless.

31:31.386 --> 31:34.450
If it really meant nothing,
and he had nothing to hide,

31:34.450 --> 31:36.216
he should've owned it.

31:36.216 --> 31:38.047
Good point.

31:38.047 --> 31:39.398
Exactly.

31:39.398 --> 31:43.718
Sometimes the truth hides inside a lie.

31:44.819 --> 31:46.382
Ma'am!

31:47.927 --> 31:51.205
This is for you tonight,
so you've got to smooth things over with her.

31:51.205 --> 31:53.075
Play nice, butter her up a little. Okay?

31:53.075 --> 31:55.828
- Right this way.
- Oh, you're all here?

31:57.250 --> 31:58.620
I'll just sit here.

31:58.620 --> 32:00.675
Come on, we set everything up.

32:00.675 --> 32:02.953
Kept it nice and warm for you.

32:04.315 --> 32:06.119
All right, then.

32:06.119 --> 32:08.198
Have a seat here.

32:13.959 --> 32:15.289
Have a fresh glass.

32:15.289 --> 32:17.018
Thank you.

32:20.962 --> 32:22.546
Ki Jun.

32:22.546 --> 32:24.161
What are you doing?

32:24.161 --> 32:25.675
Pour her a drink.

32:35.550 --> 32:37.874
What were you all talking about
so passionately?

32:37.874 --> 32:40.587
I saw you on my way in,
you were really going at it.

32:40.587 --> 32:43.124
Oh, Well...

32:43.124 --> 32:44.704
Ma'am,

32:44.704 --> 32:46.886
if you kiss someone,
that means you're dating, right?

32:48.497 --> 32:49.877
What?

32:53.977 --> 32:55.744
What kind of question is that?

33:01.219 --> 33:04.043
You were talking about Manager Do.

33:04.043 --> 33:07.896
Oh my, work talk at a team dinner?
You workaholics.

33:07.896 --> 33:09.953
Enough. Let's talk about something fun.

33:09.953 --> 33:11.974
Why? It's interesting.

33:11.974 --> 33:15.383
Work talk at a drinking table kills the mood.

33:15.383 --> 33:18.249
All right, let's have a toast first.

33:18.249 --> 33:20.778
Fill them up.

33:20.778 --> 33:22.337
Thank you.

33:22.337 --> 33:25.234
To Audit Team 3, the biggest workaholics.

33:25.234 --> 33:27.939
- Cheers!
- Cheers!

33:41.680 --> 33:43.328
I'm okay.

33:43.328 --> 33:46.645
So... should we do a second round?

33:46.645 --> 33:49.751
You guys go ahead and blow off some steam.

33:49.751 --> 33:51.282
Talk behind my back a little too.

33:51.282 --> 33:53.305
Come on, don't say that.

33:53.305 --> 33:54.489
We...

33:54.489 --> 33:56.268
Especially Ki Jun here,

33:56.268 --> 33:59.865
he really likes you, really respects you.

33:59.865 --> 34:01.269
That's right.

34:01.269 --> 34:05.515
You're honestly the coolest boss ever.

34:05.515 --> 34:07.012
He's drunk.

34:07.012 --> 34:08.383
Mr. Baek,

34:08.383 --> 34:10.690
weren't you the one complaining about bosses?

34:10.690 --> 34:13.129
Saying they should be a fence for their team,

34:13.129 --> 34:17.048
all fired up like this?

34:17.048 --> 34:19.693
Back then, I didn't know any better.

34:19.693 --> 34:21.159
But now...

34:21.159 --> 34:25.652
you're the best boss we've got.

34:29.028 --> 34:30.552
Ki Jun,

34:30.552 --> 34:34.338
you should treat her better.

34:35.616 --> 34:39.049
All right, we should get going.

34:40.189 --> 34:43.460
Yeah, let's call it a night.

34:43.460 --> 34:47.150
Ki Jun, grab her a cab before you go.
It's late.

34:47.150 --> 34:49.255
- No, it's okay.
- Come on.

34:49.255 --> 34:51.650
Make sure she gets one. I'm counting on you.

34:51.650 --> 34:53.999
- See you tomorrow.
- Bye.

34:53.999 --> 34:55.891
All right. Get home safe.

34:55.891 --> 34:57.242
Sir...

34:58.277 --> 35:00.135
No, it's too late.

35:00.135 --> 35:02.563
- That's a shame.
- No.

35:03.184 --> 35:05.868
They think I hate you, don't they?

35:06.507 --> 35:09.439
Best team ever.

35:09.439 --> 35:11.446
They're good people.

35:13.030 --> 35:14.532
So...

35:16.412 --> 35:18.703
You don't hate me, right?

35:40.000 --> 35:42.875
Oh, there's a cab. See you tomorrow.

35:49.568 --> 35:52.258
- AL Tower, please.
- Sure.

35:57.875 --> 35:59.369
Sir, you can go ahead.

35:59.369 --> 36:00.782
What are you doing?

36:03.109 --> 36:05.319
It's late. I'll ride with you.

36:05.319 --> 36:08.747
- You saw me get in. That's enough.
- There's something I want to ask.

36:14.805 --> 36:17.015
Did it really mean nothing to you?

36:18.152 --> 36:20.905
That kiss we had?

36:23.286 --> 36:24.909
Don't read into it.

36:24.909 --> 36:26.148
It was just an accident.

36:26.148 --> 36:29.608
So we just pretend nothing happened?

36:30.470 --> 36:33.220
What's with you? This isn't your usual thing.

36:33.220 --> 36:35.267
Why are you acting like it was your first kiss?

36:35.267 --> 36:38.827
It's because it wasn't.
That's how I know this was different.

36:41.432 --> 36:42.889
So what now?

36:42.889 --> 36:44.710
We kissed, so we date?

36:44.710 --> 36:46.562
Should we?

36:47.540 --> 36:49.223
Let's find out.

36:49.223 --> 36:50.473
What it really was.

36:50.473 --> 36:53.585
Whether it was just a moment or...

36:54.446 --> 36:56.623
something more between us.

36:56.623 --> 36:58.452
I want to know.

37:03.037 --> 37:05.062
And how do we do that?

37:06.057 --> 37:07.826
Sleep together?

37:07.826 --> 37:09.703
Want to try?

37:09.703 --> 37:11.807
- What?
- Then get out.

37:11.807 --> 37:14.690
- Sir, please stop here.
- Okay.

37:22.127 --> 37:23.238
What are you doing?

37:23.238 --> 37:24.760
Get out.

37:27.107 --> 37:28.955
Ma'am.

37:34.499 --> 37:37.479
You said you wanted to find out.

37:39.179 --> 37:41.791
What if I actually followed you?

37:50.936 --> 37:52.640
That's enough.

37:52.640 --> 37:54.737
I get what you're doing now.

37:54.737 --> 37:57.221
I'll try playing it cool too.

37:59.828 --> 38:02.572
But let me ask you one thing.

38:02.572 --> 38:05.442
After a kiss like that,

38:05.442 --> 38:08.643
why are you pushing me away this hard?

38:08.643 --> 38:11.419
Is it because I'm not your type?

38:11.419 --> 38:15.963
Or is it because you're my boss

38:16.665 --> 38:18.440
and I'm just someone under you?

38:20.645 --> 38:22.762
Or...

38:22.762 --> 38:25.018
is there someone else?

38:29.310 --> 38:31.236
In Ah.

38:37.110 --> 38:38.861
In Ah.

38:45.057 --> 38:47.221
I'm glad I got to see you.

38:49.669 --> 38:53.628
You changed your number, didn't you?

38:53.628 --> 38:56.464
You should've told me.

39:01.682 --> 39:04.440
Who do you think you are?

39:17.720 --> 39:20.494
You really are a stalker now, huh?

39:23.521 --> 39:25.651
I'm just worried, that's all.

39:25.651 --> 39:26.953
Who is that?

39:26.953 --> 39:28.545
This is getting intense.

39:30.704 --> 39:33.709
I heard you were back in Korea.

39:33.709 --> 39:35.963
I just wanted to see you.

39:37.644 --> 39:40.549
And where exactly did you hear that?

39:41.343 --> 39:43.801
This is a serious breach of privacy.

39:45.264 --> 39:46.736
And...

39:47.871 --> 39:51.088
Since when do we keep in touch?

39:53.397 --> 39:55.119
I'm sorry.

39:56.377 --> 39:58.026
For...

39:58.944 --> 40:02.361
leaving you on your own all this time.

40:02.361 --> 40:03.544
I really am.

40:05.207 --> 40:07.005
I'm sorry.

40:16.075 --> 40:18.450
That doesn't mean much to me.

40:20.618 --> 40:23.786
If you actually feel even a little sorry,

40:25.595 --> 40:28.403
then just leave me alone.

40:30.245 --> 40:33.169
If you call again or show up here,

40:33.169 --> 40:36.044
I'll report you for stalking.

40:40.871 --> 40:42.653
Don't ever come back.

40:45.229 --> 40:47.106
In Ah...

41:08.795 --> 41:09.870
That was good.

41:09.870 --> 41:11.567
Hey, we doing a third round?

41:11.567 --> 41:13.182
I know some great spots.

41:13.182 --> 41:16.293
You're a newlywed, man. Go home.

41:17.440 --> 41:19.325
My wife's at a work dinner.

41:19.325 --> 41:21.952
I've got to enjoy...

41:23.562 --> 41:25.022
this freedom.

41:31.553 --> 41:33.076
That was her, right?

41:33.076 --> 41:35.503
- The one who caused a scene at your wedding.
- Yes.

41:35.503 --> 41:36.800
Almost ruined my life.

41:36.800 --> 41:38.657
I was just doing my job,
playing nice as a sales guy,

41:38.657 --> 41:40.073
and she blew it way out of proportion.

41:40.073 --> 41:42.046
You did kiss her, though.

41:42.800 --> 41:45.577
I was drunk. It was a mistake.

41:45.577 --> 41:48.085
What's the big deal? Don't be so uptight.

41:48.085 --> 41:49.847
All right, all right.

41:49.847 --> 41:52.188
- So where to for round three?
- You paying?

41:52.188 --> 41:54.152
- Yeah, I got it.
- Hey.

41:54.152 --> 41:55.365
Hey, Manager Do.

41:55.365 --> 41:58.231
Isn't that your wife?

42:01.971 --> 42:04.484
- Manager Do!
- Hey.

42:08.200 --> 42:10.100
Hey!

42:12.213 --> 42:14.201
Let go!

42:14.201 --> 42:15.691
Hey, who the hell are you?

42:15.691 --> 42:17.162
Stop.

42:17.162 --> 42:20.871
This jerk was kissing my wife!

42:20.871 --> 42:24.168
What would you do? You'd lose it too, right?

42:24.168 --> 42:25.475
Is that true?

42:25.475 --> 42:26.782
You know...

42:26.782 --> 42:30.092
We had too much to drink at the dinner,

42:30.092 --> 42:32.325
so we were both pretty drunk,

42:33.142 --> 42:34.693
and it's cold out tonight,

42:34.693 --> 42:39.862
- so we were just trying to warm up a bit...
- What?

42:39.862 --> 42:43.301
You kiss because it's cold?
Are you still drunk?

42:43.301 --> 42:45.325
What, everyone outside's kissing now?

42:45.325 --> 42:48.862
Sir, we're really not involved.

42:48.862 --> 42:51.128
I admit I messed up.

42:51.128 --> 42:52.838
I was just drunk.

42:52.838 --> 42:54.752
It didn't mean anything.

42:54.752 --> 42:57.554
Shut up!

42:57.554 --> 42:59.398
A kiss means nothing?

42:59.398 --> 43:03.757
So what, you sleep together for nothing too?
Marry for nothing?

43:06.339 --> 43:07.983
Come on.

43:08.732 --> 43:11.005
Why my wife...

43:24.682 --> 43:27.026
He had a hospital wristband on.

43:27.026 --> 43:29.680
He's been admitted with a brain tumor.

43:29.680 --> 43:32.890
We were concerned when he left without notice,

43:32.890 --> 43:35.559
but it looks like a temporary spike
in intracranial pressure.

43:35.559 --> 43:37.836
He should regain consciousness soon.

43:37.836 --> 43:42.288
Sorry to ask, but how are you related to him?

43:47.169 --> 43:48.499
I'm his daughter.

43:48.499 --> 43:49.809
Not legally, though.

43:49.809 --> 43:51.873
Oh, I see.

43:51.873 --> 43:54.133
We couldn't reach any family.

43:54.133 --> 43:58.619
His medical bills are also quite overdue,
so it's been a bit difficult.

43:58.619 --> 44:00.863
He has a wife and a son.

44:00.863 --> 44:04.463
We haven't been able to reach
any family members at all.

45:26.493 --> 45:29.338
You're really seeing me at my worst.

45:32.698 --> 45:35.025
I'm not close with my dad either.

45:40.155 --> 45:42.505
Never really had the chance.

45:42.505 --> 45:45.205
He passed away before I was born.

45:48.423 --> 45:51.055
But I still grew up happy.

45:51.055 --> 45:54.879
My mom, both grandmas,

45:54.879 --> 45:57.669
my great-aunts, my aunts,

45:57.669 --> 46:00.049
my older cousins...

46:00.049 --> 46:03.266
My oldest, my middle, and my youngest sister...

46:03.266 --> 46:05.394
They absolutely spoiled me.

46:07.506 --> 46:10.066
You had a lot of women around growing up.

46:13.590 --> 46:16.441
I mostly played with my sisters,

46:17.042 --> 46:21.133
so I liked playing house,
playing with dolls and all that.

46:21.133 --> 46:23.904
My mom hated it.

46:23.904 --> 46:26.637
If she caught me playing with dolls,

46:26.637 --> 46:28.954
I'd get in serious trouble.

46:28.954 --> 46:33.390
And if I cried after getting hit,
I'd get yelled at for that too.

46:33.390 --> 46:35.621
"Men don't cry," she'd say.

46:36.850 --> 46:38.785
She was probably worried

46:40.083 --> 46:44.300
you wouldn't grow up strong enough
to fill your father's role.

46:44.300 --> 46:45.699
Yeah.

46:48.593 --> 46:52.044
I get it now.

46:52.044 --> 46:55.754
But I guess it left a mark.

46:57.725 --> 47:00.207
This is really a secret, though.

47:01.022 --> 47:02.402
I still...

47:07.616 --> 47:10.895
sleep holding a stuffed animal.

47:16.578 --> 47:18.504
Don't tell anyone.

47:19.514 --> 47:22.151
I've never told anyone that before.

47:22.151 --> 47:27.051
You told me something that personal,
probably so I wouldn't feel embarrassed.

47:29.206 --> 47:31.604
I appreciate that,
but I still feel like I'm losing here.

47:31.604 --> 47:34.066
You don't have to be so hard on me.

47:36.550 --> 47:37.943
Yeah.

47:55.038 --> 47:56.638
I think

47:58.851 --> 48:01.901
I was seven when I first saw

48:01.901 --> 48:03.810
my father.

48:05.060 --> 48:07.334
He was a married man.

48:32.614 --> 48:35.611
Are you out of your mind?
What are you doing here?

48:35.611 --> 48:36.750
In Ah,

48:36.750 --> 48:38.627
say hello. That's your dad.

48:38.627 --> 48:40.573
Hello.

48:42.484 --> 48:43.895
What is this supposed to be?

48:43.895 --> 48:45.781
A protest? You here for child support?

48:45.781 --> 48:48.095
You said you'd raise her on your own.

48:48.095 --> 48:52.078
- She should say hello. You're her dad.
- Don't call me "Dad."

48:52.078 --> 48:53.688
People talk in this town.

48:53.688 --> 48:55.085
Once rumors start,

48:55.085 --> 48:58.931
neither of you will be able to
live here normally.

48:58.931 --> 49:00.687
So just go.

49:15.872 --> 49:17.796
He wasn't wrong.

49:19.379 --> 49:22.371
In a small town, scandal can ruin you.

49:24.105 --> 49:26.574
The mistress and her illegitimate child.

49:28.352 --> 49:31.223
We didn't even have the right
to grieve our own misery.

49:45.673 --> 49:48.387
All I wanted was
to go somewhere no one knew us.

49:49.579 --> 49:51.605
That's all I ever thought about.

49:55.194 --> 49:57.991
It wasn't until I came to Seoul for college

49:57.991 --> 50:01.004
that I finally felt like
I could live a normal life.

50:05.352 --> 50:07.519
- This is so good.
- It is, right?

50:10.308 --> 50:12.238
Mom!

50:14.302 --> 50:16.133
Heading to work?

50:16.133 --> 50:17.996
See you later!

50:23.366 --> 50:25.894
- That's your mom?
- Yes.

50:26.756 --> 50:28.620
No way.

50:28.620 --> 50:29.848
What?

50:30.635 --> 50:33.259
Mom, are you really doing this?

50:33.259 --> 50:35.513
A nude model?

50:35.513 --> 50:37.057
Seriously?

50:37.057 --> 50:40.415
I saw the posting by chance.

50:40.415 --> 50:44.375
The pay was better than anything else,
so I took it.

50:45.044 --> 50:47.847
I just don't get it, Mom.

50:47.847 --> 50:53.910
Most people wouldn't do that,
no matter how much it pays.

50:56.419 --> 50:58.235
It feels freeing.

50:59.305 --> 51:00.555
What?

51:01.142 --> 51:03.830
When I'm standing there,

51:05.816 --> 51:08.283
I feel free.

51:08.873 --> 51:10.723
And...

51:10.723 --> 51:12.431
I start to

51:14.651 --> 51:16.345
like myself.

51:16.951 --> 51:19.282
For the first time in my life.

51:20.278 --> 51:22.302
So you feel free

51:22.302 --> 51:26.024
standing naked in front of people?

51:26.995 --> 51:29.946
Shouldn't you feel ashamed?

51:30.625 --> 51:32.391
I felt sorry for you.

51:32.391 --> 51:35.422
I believed you when you said
you didn't know he was married.

51:35.422 --> 51:38.414
So no matter what people said,
I held my head up for you.

51:39.271 --> 51:40.882
But

51:40.882 --> 51:43.414
maybe they were right.

51:44.085 --> 51:45.969
You really are that kind of woman.

51:52.129 --> 51:53.739
I'm leaving.

51:53.739 --> 51:54.922
In Ah...

51:54.922 --> 51:56.014
I finally...

51:56.014 --> 51:59.591
realized there's only one way

51:59.591 --> 52:01.970
to get out from under this label.

52:01.970 --> 52:03.828
To stop being your daughter.

52:43.297 --> 52:44.521
Hello?

52:44.521 --> 52:47.292
Hello, this is Lieutenant Yoon Ha Jun
from Nambu Police Station.

52:47.292 --> 52:49.570
Are you Ms. Joo Kyung Hee's daughter?

52:56.842 --> 53:00.978
She was in an accident
at the Sillim intersection.

53:00.978 --> 53:04.249
It looks like she came by your place

53:04.249 --> 53:06.539
and waited outside late into the night.

53:06.539 --> 53:08.620
And she may have been on her way back.

53:22.920 --> 53:24.844
[Phone Contacts]

53:24.844 --> 53:28.080
[Shop] [My daughter In Ah]

53:28.080 --> 53:30.684
[Art Class]

53:41.303 --> 53:43.636
[Incoming Call]
[Art Class]

53:46.100 --> 53:47.463
Hello?

53:47.463 --> 53:48.917
Mrs. Kyung Hee,

53:48.917 --> 53:51.804
you're coming in Friday, right?

53:51.804 --> 53:54.928
We were worried since we couldn't reach you.

55:16.258 --> 55:18.575
I finally understand

55:18.575 --> 55:20.694
what my mom meant.

55:21.589 --> 55:24.500
Throwing yourself into the world,

55:25.456 --> 55:28.297
just as you are, without judgment.

55:29.189 --> 55:31.360
And I realized something.

55:31.360 --> 55:33.500
I've never,

55:35.682 --> 55:37.461
not even for a moment,

55:39.809 --> 55:41.703
forgiven her...

55:42.480 --> 55:45.086
or myself.

55:57.150 --> 55:58.539
Are you crying?

55:59.174 --> 56:02.187
Hey, why are you crying? Are you drunk?

56:02.187 --> 56:03.215
Have some water.

56:03.215 --> 56:04.753
It just hurts.

56:12.554 --> 56:14.870
Feels like you must've been really lonely.

56:25.393 --> 56:27.635
You keep acting tough,

56:29.746 --> 56:31.503
and that just makes it sadder.

56:37.810 --> 56:39.167
Hey.

56:56.833 --> 56:58.755
Don't get hurt.

57:02.975 --> 57:06.159
Anyway, your drunk habits are awful.

58:12.871 --> 58:15.168
We're here.

58:15.168 --> 58:16.964
Wake up.

58:17.631 --> 58:18.968
Mr. Noh.

58:18.968 --> 58:21.498
Hey, wake up.

58:22.665 --> 58:24.802
Mr. Noh! Hey!

58:27.158 --> 58:29.623
Sorry. We're getting out.

58:32.798 --> 58:34.185
Come on.

58:51.614 --> 58:53.639
[Noh Ki Jun]

58:53.639 --> 58:55.881
[Address]
Building 101, unit 1002?

59:05.923 --> 59:08.068
At least you won't freeze to death.

59:12.084 --> 59:13.482
What the...

59:15.579 --> 59:17.524
You wait and see.

59:17.524 --> 59:20.443
I'm going to make you pay for this,

59:21.028 --> 59:24.523
using every bit of authority I've got.

59:41.726 --> 59:43.123
Mr. Noh.

59:43.123 --> 59:46.272
Hey, get it together.

59:49.798 --> 59:51.188
Your subconscious will remember.

59:51.188 --> 59:53.658
Press it. Come on.

59:53.658 --> 59:55.242
Press it.

01:00:45.487 --> 01:00:48.697
- How are you feeling, ma'am?
- Ki Jun, what is this?

01:00:48.697 --> 01:00:51.014
Is there a reason Joo In Ah shouldn't know?

01:00:51.014 --> 01:00:52.774
About us?

01:00:52.774 --> 01:00:54.071
It's your private life.

01:00:54.071 --> 01:00:57.091
Something like this isn't going to shake me.

01:00:57.091 --> 01:00:59.695
You're not curious about my private life?

01:00:59.695 --> 01:01:01.608
We kissed, huh?

01:01:01.608 --> 01:01:03.158
Let's stop pretending.

01:01:03.158 --> 01:01:04.798
You already know.

01:01:04.798 --> 01:01:06.918
That question you asked...

01:01:06.918 --> 01:01:09.675
Why I keep pushing you away...

01:01:09.675 --> 01:01:10.982
The real reason is...

01:01:10.982 --> 01:01:12.786
Ma'am!

01:01:13.785 --> 01:01:15.822
I've lost it.

01:01:15.822 --> 01:01:17.685
Because of you.
